      "__comment": "Row groups the seven per-welle state tiles. The persona_engine_phase_3c_welle_state gauge is produced by scripts/phase-3c-welle-status-emitter.py and carries one of the five state values: pre_cutover, in_cutover, post_cutover, rollback_active, welle_complete."
