      "title": "Henrik-Audit-Sign-Off Status (PRE/TEL/POST 3-Phase, ADR-0066 §Henrik-Bandwidth)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35},
      "collapsed": false,
      "__comment": "Per-welle three-phase audit-sign-off indicator. Source: wakir_henrik_audit_signoff{welle=...,phase=PRE|TEL|POST} gauge (0=pending, 1=signed, -1=blocked). Henrik's audit-trail-template (ADR-0066 Mitigation-2) emits this gauge from scripts/audit/henrik-signoff-emitter.py once that script lands. Until then, the tiles read 'pending' uniformly — an operator can override by writing the gauge value via the persona-engine Prometheus pushgateway."
    },
